# Keep every text file LF, in the repository and on checkout.
#
# The source-scanning tests match needles that contain "\n" (for example
# tests/unit_edits.rs and tests/resample_settings.rs). A CRLF checkout turns
# those needles into no-match and fails tests that have nothing to do with the
# code. `eol=lf` overrides core.autocrlf on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf